{"synopsis":"Na Kang In membuka matanya di tengah-tengah Korea Selatan, pada tahun 2024. Dia tidak ingat siapa dia atau di mana dia berada, tapi dia mengetahui dari dukungan tempur AI Jeon Ji In, di dalam tubuhnya, bahwa dia adalah anggota dari Aliansi Bumi pada tahun 2082. Dia perlu mengumpulkan informasi untuk mendapatkan kembali ingatannya dan mencari tahu mengapa dia datang ke sini… Na Kang In, yang tidak punya apa-apa selain tahu bagaimana melakukan segalanya, sedang mengalami masa sulit beradaptasi dengan Bumi!","alternative_title":"다 잘하는 히어로, A Hero Who Is Good at Everything, Hero of All Trades","author":"Hwang Gyu Young","artist":"White Eagle","chapters":[{"number":"86","chapter":"86","slug":"03d7ab21-d9e2-47b6-a397-25584ea75c73","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"8035658c-3ad5-4802-8d63-9d2f80951a4c","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"69d1e805-01b5-4b77-84ed-a5c74c3e5b44","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"04580bdb-6944-4e3d-817b-4f9144eec7c7","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"0a7d99aa-a796-432e-a5c5-bfd970afc8fa","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"aeaf1037-b1d6-4154-b334-c9e06c35a1ce","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"9ef631de-b49d-490c-80c9-0ea30b5c7fa9","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"420706e5-4ea6-4adf-b159-f63d7d2cdfaf","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"205e7486-a4b9-41d1-b7e8-be0dd5102f77","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"64ab6af5-6311-4c4c-ac92-07c2e745f548","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"d4ab0cde-21fa-4579-b991-19431ba3764a","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"752a5ea9-35e2-4827-9494-fefe9b68f8ea","date":"2026-04-29","images":[]},{"number":"74","chap